&P478824 = JAC 28, xxx 04 
#atf: lang akk 
@tablet 
@obverse 
1. a-na i3-li2-sa3-am-szi# 
#tr.en: To Ilī-Šamšī 
2. qi2-bi2-ma# 
#tr.en: speak!
3. um-ma bi-da-ti-ma-x-[x]-ma 
#tr.en: thus  Bidatima-…:  
4. {d}suen li-ba-al-[li-it,-ka] 
#tr.en: May Sin grant your health! 
5. x-hi sza 1(disz) 1/3(disz) ma-<na> ku3-babbar 
#tr.en: From the 1 1/3 mina silver 
6. in-na-ad-nu-u2-ma 
#tr.en: given (me), 
7. 5/6(disz) ma-na ku3-babbar a-na _sze_-e-em 
#tr.en: 5/6 mina silver for barley 
8. at-ta-di-in 
#tr.en: I paid back;
9. 1/2(disz) ma-na ku3-babbar {disz}{d}szul-pa-e3 x-x 
#tr.en: the (remaining) 1/2 mina silver by Šul-pa’e-... 
10. usz-ta-bi-la-ak-kum 
#tr.en: I had brought to you;
11. u3 {disz}in-na-rat? 
#tr.en: further: since Innarat 
12. ut-ra-am qa2-du 3(asz) gur _sze_-a-am 
#tr.en: is superior to me, with 3 gur barley 
13. a-t,a-ra-da-ak-ku-usz 
#tr.en: I will dispatch him to you;
14. u3 a-na _sze_-im sza ma-an-ma-an x 
#tr.en: further: concerning someone’s barley: 
15. is,-ba-tu-ni-ni-ma
#tr.en: the people here have seized me and  
16. _sze_-a-am id-ba-bu
#tr.en: said: “barley!” 
